        <mxCell id="eks-note" value="Secrets entram nos pods via CSI → /mnt/secrets-store/*.json → eval no bash -c do container (lidos só na subida do pod).&lt;br&gt;Deploy: push na develop → saq-ci docker-kustomize-deploy → ECR shared → bot commita a tag no overlay dev-qasmexhml → Sync manual no ArgoCD." style="shape=note;size=14;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="300" y="490" width="550" height="76" as="geometry" />
